        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="job">
        <div class="job-header">
          <div>
            <h3>Kion</h3>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="role">
          <h4>GCP Software Engineer</h4>
          <p class="date">September 2020 - July 2022 (1 year 11 months)</p>
          <p class="location-text">Fulton, Maryland, United States</p>
          <p class="description">As Kion's GCP Software Engineer, I spearheaded the company's efforts to support Google Cloud Platform in its cloud governance solution.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Architecting microservices</li>
            <li>Building internal SDKs and libraries</li>
            <li>Providing level 3 support for customers using Google Cloud in Kion</li>
            <li>Full stack feature development (GO + Angular)</li>
